# Test: OSPFv2 Router Information LSA withdraw (RFC 7770 / RFC 2328 sec 14, spec-ospf-ext-3).
#
# VALIDATES: after RI is originated, disabling `router-information` and re-running the
# self-LSA pass MaxAge-flushes the RI opaque LSAs through the carrier's withdraw path so peers
# purge them.
# PREVENTS: a disabled RI advertisement lingering in the database.

cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=go test -v ./internal/plugins/ospf -run TestOSPFRIWithdrawFunctional -count=1:timeout=60s
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stdout:contains=PASS
